## Model card

- **Name:** Crouton Alpha
- **Short description:** Anonymous stealth AI model on OpenRouter, optimized for high-volume developer workflows, agent sub-tasks, and scalable coding. Supports multimodal input (text, images, audio, video, files). 1M context window. Free during preview. Speculated to be from Meta's ecosystem based on deployment fingerprinting — unconfirmed.
- **Provider / access:** OpenRouter (`stealth/crouton-alpha`). Anonymous provider.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026 (stealth preview); knowledge cutoff unknown.
- **IDs:** `stealth/crouton-alpha`
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens (1M). Max output 943,718 tokens.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, audio, video, files in; text out; configurable reasoning effort (minimal/low/medium/high).
- **Pricing (as of 2026):** Free ($0.00/M in and out) during preview. Subject to change or sudden removal.
- **Architecture:** Unknown. Anonymous stealth model. Speculated Meta ecosystem lineage (unconfirmed). No official parameter count or architecture details.

